---
import JournalArticle from '../../components/JournalArticle.astro';
const title='A Diwali effects tool, with a little festival in it';
const description='A custom AI-built Diwali motion experience, directed by Shubham Shinde and shown through a 14-second isometric showcase of diya, anar, chakri, kandil and kamal.';
const poster='assets/journal/diwali/kandil-poster.jpg';
---
<JournalArticle readTime="1 min read" slug="diwali-isometric-motion" title={title} description={description} shareImage={poster} shareAlt="Five glowing Diwali objects arranged across a dark isometric grid" projectUrl="/assets/journal/diwali/kandil-motion.mp4" projectLabel="Watch the Diwali effects showcase" ctaText="Watch the showcase" keywords={['AI-built creative tool','Diwali effects','Diwali motion design','isometric animation','creative technology','designer in India']}>
  <figure class="journal-media"><video controls playsinline preload="none" poster={poster} aria-label="14-second showcase of the Diwali effects experience"><source src="/assets/journal/diwali/kandil-motion.mp4" type="video/mp4"></video><figcaption>The 14-second showcase of the Diwali effects experience.</figcaption></figure>
  <section class="journal-copy">
    <h2>What it is</h2>
    <p>A Diwali effects experience built around five familiar forms: <strong>diya, anar, chakri, kandil and kamal</strong>. Each sits on its own island on an isometric grid, with its own colour and moment of light.</p>
    <p>I wrote the concept prompt and AI built the experience; I directed which objects belong and how each one should feel.</p>
    <h2>How it works</h2>
    <ol class="journal-steps">
      <li><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 3l9 5-9 5-9-5z"/><path d="M3 13l9 5 9-5"/></svg><div><b>Five islands</b><span>Diya, anar, chakri, kandil and kamal, one per plinth.</span></div></li>
      <li><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 3v4M12 17v4M3 12h4M17 12h4M6 6l2.5 2.5M15.5 15.5 18 18M6 18l2.5-2.5M15.5 8.5 18 6"/></svg><div><b>One effect each</b><span>A warm flare, a spin, sparks, a soft glow, opening petals.</span></div></li>
      <li><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="3" y="7" width="12" height="10" rx="1.5"/><path d="M15 10l6-3v10l-6-3"/></svg><div><b>The camera tours</b><span>It moves through the set, one effect at a time.</span></div></li>
      <li><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4 9V4h5M20 9V4h-5M4 15v5h5M20 15v5h-5"/></svg><div><b>Then pulls back</b><span>The whole arrangement clicks into view.</span></div></li>
    </ol>
  </section>
</JournalArticle>
